ond system other operations. If the client requested the arithmetic involving the operator from the first client then the response is directed to the client.If the arithmetic involves the operation from the second server then the operation is first checked in the initial server then checks in the next server.If the operation is found it computes the calculation and returns the value to the first server, then this server returns the required response to the client. If the requested operation is not found in any server then it prompts for any other operation.","topics":[],"score":1846,"global_rank":417035},{"name":"gitskim/football_udacity","owner":"gitskim","html_url":"https://github.com/gitskim/football_udacity","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"One of Udacity projects with widget and sync adapters","topics":[],"score":1846,"global_rank":417036},{"name":"kevintrancs/Todo_Planner","owner":"kevintrancs","html_url":"https://github.com/kevintrancs/Todo_Planner","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"THIS IS ONLY FOR EDUCATIONAL PURPOSES AND SO I CAN PRINT WITHOUT .ZIP FILES FOR HARD COPY. I DO NOT GIVE PERMISSION FOR ANYONE TO CHEAT OFF THIS.","topics":[],"score":1846,"global_rank":417040},{"name":"scaryghost/RemoteDataLocker","owner":"scaryghost","html_url":"https://github.com/scaryghost/RemoteDataLocker","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Simple server to store and retrieve key-value pairs","topics":[],"score":1846,"global_rank":417043},{"name":"mooman219/CSCI261","owner":"mooman219","html_url":"https://github.com/mooman219/CSCI261","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Analysis of Algorithms","topics":[],"score":1846,"global_rank":417062},{"name":"ayushk92/WatchFace","owner":"ayushk92","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushk92/WatchFace","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This project implements basic android wear watch face","topic